Package: buRst
Type: Package
Title: Discrete Likelihood Inference of Transcriptional Bursting from scSLAM-seq
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person("Teresa", "Rummel", email = "teresa.rummel@ur.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Methods to infer transcriptional bursting parameters
    (burst size and burst frequency) from scSLAM-seq data by combining
    discrete likelihood profiles with mechanistic RNA count distributions
    under a bursting model.
